ashes, soft drops, long clears, and deceptive net shots—just like the pros.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energetic Gameplay:</strong> Responsive controls and quick matches keep the action intense and fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Characters:</strong> Pick from a roster of expressive, stylized athletes, each with their own style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Courts:</strong> Play across visually striking  outdoor badminton arenas.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Casual Sport Series: Badminton delivers fast-paced, energetic gameplay that captures the thrill of this lightning-quick sport. Ready to serve, smash, and soar to victory? The court awaits!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694260/07f1d0cb90ff09df4d99979f50d63005d43bfd0a/header.jpg?t=1762776370", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694260/c660de8ee9eeeb6769eb0ea73d925b872adaaec5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762776370", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694260/c660de8ee9eeeb6769eb0ea73d925b872adaaec5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762776370", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo E8400, 3.0GHz or AMD Athlon 64 X2 6000+, 3.0GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce 9600 GT or AMD HD 3870 512MB or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Use controller for better experience</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Revulo Games LLC